      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-06T18:40:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done\n\nFrom my observations without a spinlock, I\u0027ll see interleaved base64 messages causing decoding issues. Adding a spinlock around `LOG_PRINTK` keeps the tokenized messages well formed.",
      "parentUuid": "5f5273b6_3d8f4646",
